    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a cycle of nothingness. first you love something, then it's taken, and then you're just left waiting for the next thing to go. it's exhausting. i'm just so tired of the cycle. it feels like there's no point in trying to fix anything or move forward when the end result is always just this emptiness. it feels like an inevitable end anyway.",
